.TH geectl-branch-copy-project 1  "geectl-branch-copy-project 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-copy\-project \- Copy a whole project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch copy\-project\fR [\fB\-\-with\-binaries\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-make\-older\fR] [\fB\-\-make\-origin\-older\fR] [\fB\-\-noservice\fR] [\fB\-\-resign\fR] [\fB\-\-comment\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-delay\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-source\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-target\-project\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy a whole project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-project\fR \fI<SOURCE_PROJECT>\fR
The project to copy from
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-project\fR \fI<TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
The project to copy to
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-binaries\fR
Copy the built binaries as well. Admin\-only on the server
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-history\fR
Copy the project history as well
.TP
\fB\-\-make\-older\fR
Make the copied project older than the source
.TP
\fB\-\-make\-origin\-older\fR
Make the copied project older than the source\*(Aqs origin
.TP
\fB\-\-noservice\fR
Do not run source services on the copied files
.TP
\fB\-\-resign\fR
Re\-sign the copied project
.TP
\fB\-\-comment\fR \fI<COMMENT>\fR
A comment recorded on the copy
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-delay\fR
Run the copy synchronously instead of as a background job
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
